id=MirageVerboseBoot
name=Mirage Verbose Boot + Anti-Bootloop
version=v1.2.0
versionCode=6
author=Mor4land
description=Real-time Linux kernel (/dev/kmsg) and Android init/system logs rendered directly onto boot screen, replacing HyperOS animation. Automatically detects genuine bootloops, disables ALL Magisk modules (including itself), and saves crash logs to /sdcard/Download/MirageBootloop_LAST.log.
